        <body>
            <div xml:id="d474">

                <pb facs="0880" n="784" xml:id="pg784"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/3391: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Eberhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-01-13T10:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">January 13,
                                1926—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:43
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>10. Congress yesterday declared the Vice Presidency vacant and sentenced Sacasa
                    lo two years’ banishment from Nicaragua.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eberhardt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
